At level 18 wizards get the spell [[Lesser Evacuate]], which is an evacuation spell for the group to a safe spot within the same zone.<br>
Wizards also get a spell called [[Translocate]] that they get at level 50. Using this spell, they can send one group member back to that group member's bind spot.<br>
